{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"AB\n            01 Work02 Craft03 Story\n          \n\n          \n          \n            \n              01 / Introduction\n              Softwareas craft.\n            \n            \n              Senior Engineer with 9+ years building across the full stack. I approach software the way an architect approaches space — with intention, structure, and care for the people who inhabit it.\n            \n          \n\n          \n          \n            \n              Featured\n              DraughtsAI\n            \n            \n              Latest Role\n              Tenpu — Sr. Engineer\n            \n            \n              Venture\n              Bostan Software\n            \n          \n        \n      \n    \n    \n      B — Architectural Precision\n      Light, grid-driven, Swiss-inspired with revealing transitions. Hybrid structure: a scrollable homepage with detail pages. Sections slide and assemble like architectural blueprints. Numbered navigation (01, 02, 03). Restraint is the statement — every element earns its place.\n      \n        StrengthsExtremely clean and scannable for recruitersGrid animations still showcase craftTimeless — won't feel dated\n        Trade-offsLess emotionally dramatic than dark themesRestraint requires more design discipline","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1774049491305}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"Alexei Bostan\n            WorkCraftAbout\n          \n\n          Senior Software Engineer\n          I build softwarethat matters\n          9+ years crafting systems across frontend, backend, and mobile — from startups to enterprise.\n        \n\n        \n        \n          Scroll\n          \n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n      \n    \n    \n      A — Cinematic Scroll\n      Dark, atmospheric, scroll-driven storytelling. One continuous flow. Sections reveal with parallax and fade-in. Feels like a documentary — each scroll reveals the next chapter. Moody palette with warm gold accents. Serif typography for editorial weight.\n      \n        StrengthsMaximally immersive and memorableScroll animations showcase frontend craftStrong emotional impact\n        Trade-offsHeavier to build (scroll orchestration)Recruiters who want to skim may need a \"jump to\" option","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774049510077}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"alexei.bostan\n            ~/work~/craft~/about\n          \n\n          \n          \n            $ whoami\n            \n              Senior SoftwareEngineer\n            \n            \n              Building at the intersection of craft and impact.\n              9 years · full-stack · 4 languages\n            \n          \n\n          \n          \n            \n              LATEST\n              DraughtsAI\n              AI-powered draughts platform\n            \n            \n              ROLE\n              Tenpu\n              Senior Software Engineer\n            \n            \n              VENTURE\n              Bostan Software\n              Independent consultancy\n            \n          \n        \n      \n    \n    \n      C — Developer Narrative\n      Dark dev-aesthetic with rich interactivity. GitHub-inspired palette meets portfolio storytelling. Terminal hints without being gimmicky. Interactive project cards with live-feeling hover states and smooth page transitions. Monospace accents signal engineering identity. The site feels like exploring a well-crafted codebase.\n      \n        StrengthsImmediately signals \"engineer\" to technical leadsDark theme naturally feels modernFamiliar to developer audience\n        Trade-offsRisk of feeling too \"developer portfolio\" if not elevatedMay not stand out to non-technical recruiters","choice":"c","id":null,"timestamp":1774049517576}
